OL,3,GNEWSACouple found dead in home were
OL,4,A'inseparable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a couple found dead at a
OL,7,Fhouse in Blackburn have described them
OL,8,Fas "inseparable".
OL,10,FIsmail Ahmed Leli, 80, and Fatima Leli,
OL,11,F78, were found with stab wounds at a
OL,12,Fhouse in Hardman Street at about 08:20
OL,13,FBST on Monday.
OL,15,FLancashire Police launched a murder
OL,16,Finvestigation and arrested a man in his
OL,17,F40s. He remains in police custody.
OL,19,FPaying tribute, the family said: "We
OL,20,Fare heartbroken to share that we have
OL,21,Flost our parents, the oldest and most
OL,22,Fcherished members of our family."
